From 4460a78350b10dcb638fb563d666f745be929381 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Loukious <24696530+Loukious@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:23:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] display: Port Onyx stock auto-brightness

Use Xiaomi Global user-point smoothing so an Auto slider preference can
retain its anchor without flattening the rest of the brightness curve.

Add the default-off Onyx sensor policy, cached on-change ALS initialization,
linear physical mapping and stock ramp equations. Dispose replaced
controllers and stale mappers during display reload. Retain Android output
limits, model lifecycle, white balance and Reduce Bright Colors ordering.

Requires the companion Onyx resource opt-in and corrected panel XMLs.
